  <item>
    <title>对谈 Cris：你生命中怎么这么多“强者”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699d551da22480add6e4b466</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699d551da22480add6e4b466</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 07:49:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>年前朋友 Cris 从香港回京探亲访友，然后我们这两个前厂工，就一起录了期播客，就这样</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎大家关注他的个人播客 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6981e940e3b98bb2defb72dd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6981e940e3b98bb2defb72dd"><span>浪人道场</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> “育人”公司和“用人”公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> &nbsp;《模仿欲望》：人类的欲望是怎么来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 我为什么开始构建内在评价体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> &nbsp;接触“专注飞机”的开发者，让我弄明白了“磕 CP”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> &nbsp;何为“个人成长”，以及大厂人的“屠龙之术”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1571">26:11</a> “君子不器”对现代人的启示是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> &nbsp;你的牛逼，与我无关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 冲浪和种地，两种不同的创业观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 融资叙事和我就做个小生意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 创业不等于一定要融资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a> &nbsp;为什么在效率至上的公司，个人难有创新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> &nbsp;把人当人，如何构建一个滋养人的组织环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3115">51:55</a> &nbsp;员工的创造力到底重不重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">53:33</a> &nbsp;一点组织玄学：为什么有些人的行为必遭反噬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> AI是人的工具还是人的替代，何为技术达尔文主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a> 我们到底要构建一个什么样的 AI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3939">65:39</a> 深圳湾公园，十日谈咖啡馆，老板和渔夫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4010">66:50</a> 让大脑闲下来是一种什么状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4119">68:39</a> 你的生命中怎么这么多“强者”，何为“强“，何为”弱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4293">71:33</a> 离开大厂的三年，过得怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节目场地支持】：北京声湃轩录音间</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Kinks - Supersonic Rocket Ship</span></p><span></span><p><span>Creedence Clearwater Revival - Cotton Fields</span></p><span></span><p><span>Status Quo - Rockin' All Over The World</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本场剪辑&amp;DJ】：Cris</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/623e8c4561e27b4fd00cc6e8/loiRsycEn-X5aKjzaTgK9JFFAc5y.m4a" length="72556529" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibUrpGZnVVlzWbQf2luqVon9h6P.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>生姜：我是善良的“既得利益者”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f4a70622654730203106c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f4a70622654730203106c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Oct 2025 09:03:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>生姜 前 AFFiNE cofounder &amp; COO，现出海咨询超级个体</span></p><p><span>AFFiNE：45k star open-source Notion/Miro Alternative on Github.（总融资额 $10M）</span></p><p><span>即刻 @生姜iris</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 当时为什么想创业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 在知乎招募到了第一位 CTO</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 第一次创业转型，从学术编辑器到开源编译器框架</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> Affine 在 Github 的爆发</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> “大佬”研发多了也会打架</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> &nbsp;创业对自我的塑造有哪些？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> &nbsp;Product Hunt 拿到了 1000 票</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">27:29</a> &nbsp;Notion 是如何做社区运营的，以及“古典”运营方法论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> 北京创业圈和珠三角创业圈的特性差别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2004">33:24</a> 创业前后对成功的定义产生了哪些变化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a> &nbsp;我是善良的“既得利益者”，以及几个做事原则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 什么是好的公司氛围，如何激发员工的创造力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2659">44:19</a> 如何跳出“绩优主义”的叙事框架，找到自己舒服的生活状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2853">47:33</a> 在字节的工作体验，为什么说大厂是新时代的国企</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3223">53:43</a> 认真不是一种态度，更像是一种能力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> &nbsp;大佬们惊人的体力和精力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3598">59:58</a> &nbsp;构建自己人生支持系统的重要性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3634">01:00:34</a> 为什么现在选择做咨询</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3835">01:03:55</a> &nbsp;人生的 Role Model：柴静和纳瓦尔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4228">01:10:28</a> 为什么说当前的社交媒体已经是“半生成”式的平台了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4487">01:14:47</a> 你会选择永生么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4595">01:16:35</a> 强烈推荐的书《不要挑战人性》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4636">01:17:16</a> &nbsp;“我们要有识别坏人的能力，才能更好地保护自己。”</span></p><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><p><span>《Life is》 Jessica Pratt</span></p><p><span>《The Winner is》 Mychael Danna</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/623e8c4561e27b4fd00cc6e8/llvmdcmYZCl9J0NM9aH330hAcjjs.m4a" length="78742307" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibUrpGZnVVlzWbQf2luqVon9h6P.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>胡杨：社交媒体为何让我们孩子们如此内耗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d5425ae924d4525ac96e0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d5425ae924d4525ac96e0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 09:18:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>胡杨，AI 心理健康方向创业者，公司详情：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mdjIxplNI--V7S-61W1jEQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mdjIxplNI--V7S-61W1jEQ"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">00:01:54</a> 当初为何选择了这样一个创业方向</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">00:06:05</a> 中国中小学生整体的心理健康状况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">00:06:30</a> 初中生抑郁检出率可高达 30% 高中生则更高</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">00:07:17</a> &nbsp;抑郁率走高的主要原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">00:09:40</a> &nbsp;90后留守儿童与 00 后 10 后留守儿童之间的一些代际差别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">00:10:50</a> &nbsp;社交媒体对于青少年的心理健康的危害</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">00:11:51</a> &nbsp;封闭环境对于心理健康的潜在影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">00:15:29</a> &nbsp;在异常丰富的信息环境下，成熟的心智为何如此重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">00:17:07</a> &nbsp;在不同经济发展程度地区，青少年心理健康的差异有哪些</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">00:21:21</a> &nbsp;什么是「烟卡」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">00:23:35</a> &nbsp;在产品层面，如何来预判一个人的心理健康程度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">00:25:49</a> &nbsp;产品的有效诊出率在什么水平</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">00:29:33</a> &nbsp;这类 AI 产品在落地时候，会遇到哪些比较大的障碍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">00:40:15</a> &nbsp;在完成检测后，后续的链接是怎么样的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2787">00:46:27</a> &nbsp;业务的商业模式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">00:53:25</a> &nbsp;如何规避或纠正“漏检 误检”这类问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3647">01:00:47</a> &nbsp;在家长的维度，做哪些事情可以有效地支持自己的小孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3886">01:04:46</a> &nbsp;国外部分发达国家，非常注重让小孩有户外互动时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3995">01:06:35</a> &nbsp;很核心的一点是，要注意引导小孩树立更健康的生活习惯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4190">01:09:50</a> &nbsp;AI 心理咨询跟人类心理咨询师，未来可能会是一个怎样的关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4462">01:14:22</a> &nbsp;对创业这件事的体会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4585">01:16:25</a> &nbsp;想找什么样的伙伴一起加入</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4972">01:22:52</a> &nbsp;推荐最近读的一本书《详谈：左晖》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5104">01:25:04</a> &nbsp;洋葱学园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5202">01:26:42</a> &nbsp;好物推荐</span></p><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><p><span>《Life is》 Jessica Pratt</span></p><p><span>《Like Eating Glass》 Bloc Party</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/623e8c4561e27b4fd00cc6e8/lgC1jqtB41B2cjqpvs-K09urZYar.m4a" length="89075605" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:31:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibUrpGZnVVlzWbQf2luqVon9h6P.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>秋爽：加密、AI ，以及如何对抗系统对人的异化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677d4c831962f0b75110f655</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677d4c831962f0b75110f655</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jan 2025 19:22:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong><span>秋爽，广告人，科幻迷，BTC 早期散户</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">00:02:29</a> 加密市场在这个周期，有哪些新的变化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">00:10:20</a> 加密市场有哪些真应用</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">00:12:38</a> 本轮 MEME 盛行可能的原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">00:20:27</a> 比特币 ETF 会对去中心化可能有负面影响么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">00:38:22</a> 如何定义「智能」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">00:45:05</a> 动物与人的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">00:52:15</a> 在 AI 时代，什么可能是最值得传递给下一代的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">01:00:01</a> 如何看待「养老」，如何理解生命质量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4236">01:10:36</a> 当生产力达到一个全新高度后，人该如何找寻「人」的价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4630">01:17:10</a> 算法是如何压制人的主动性和创造性的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">01:18:30</a> 广告行业是如何「完蛋」的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4827">01:20:27</a> 结构性问题：人的心灵是如何生病的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4883">01:21:23</a> 为何推荐大家多听播客这类长内容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4975">01:22:55</a> 卡钦斯基《论工业社会及其未来》对当代的启示</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5612">01:33:32</a> 个人如何对抗工业社会对人的异化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5960">01:39:20</a> 何为「文明社会」，生产力和文明并非正向相关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6176">01:42:56</a> Luigi</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6840">01:54:00</a> 人被系统的「原子化」，为何如此普遍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7022">01:57:02</a> 「垄断」的本质是什么，如何打破垄断</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7239">02:00:39</a> 星际移民、马斯克和战争</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7735">02:08:55</a> 全览效应 overview effect</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8323">02:18:43</a> 明朝在科技领域中失败教训</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8375">02:19:35</a> 「提出问题」的价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8426">02:20:26</a> 如何对抗现实的重力</span></p><p><strong><span>本期提到的书籍：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>《西方的没落》斯宾格勒</span></p></li><li><p><span>《暮色将尽》戴安娜.阿西尔</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>《Life is》 Jessica Pratt</span></p></li><li><p><span>《Born Sleepy》 Pepe California</span></p></li></ul><p><span>特此说明：本播客所提及的内容，仅作为个人观点信息分享，不构成任何投资建议。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsX8hbuOv7unFxbZ_P47Tyj3ERkw.m4a" length="147164887" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:31:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibUrpGZnVVlzWbQf2luqVon9h6P.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Shep：物来顺应、未来不迎、当下不杂、既过不恋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659d2bda926ad7aad0b3bf51</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659d2bda926ad7aad0b3bf51</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jan 2024 11:19:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Web3是座炼狱场，每个人都在当中炙烤，而shep却是个有些特别的存在，你在他身上很少感受到纠结的情绪，总是显得淡然洒脱，甚至稍显“冷漠”。但他却又时常按头身边的朋友，蛮横地让人强制暴富，让大家重新相信人性的光辉和革命的力量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在今年以Ordinals为代表的比特币生态行情中，他屡次捕鲸成功，事后又微微一笑，这很难不让人好奇，这次我在清迈捕shep成功，让我们一起走近科学。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期话题：</span></strong><span>Ordinals生态、Brc20、Atomicals、个人投资心得等，enjoy</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong><span>Shep，现Web3开发者，前某瓣工程师、NextDAO联合发起人，推特@</span><a href="https://twitter.com/shep_eth" data-url="https://twitter.com/shep_eth"><span>shep.eth</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a></span></strong><span> 正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a></span></strong><span> 嘉宾履历，入圈故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 初读比特币白皮书时的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 如何理解以太坊的价值，在定位上跟btc的差别是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 如何看待brc20协议，其演化路径、协议亮点和想象力都在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 2023年的brc20与2017年的erc20 ico有哪些异同点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> 这波brc20的得以崛起的天时地利人和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> 如何看待solana在23年的反弹以及以太坊的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">32:19</a> 整个web3或区块链行业的主要挑战点是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> 区块链技术得以大规模普及的节点会是在什么时候？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 星际网络与区块链结合的可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 除了brc20，还比较关注的协议：tap 、atomicals以及rune协议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 为何会如此关注atomicals协议，当时去挖atom的动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2955">49:15</a> domo和atomincals的创始人在人格特质上的不同（domo给人的感觉很open又很保守，而后者显得更深思熟虑，也有很强的前瞻规划能力）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">58:58</a> &nbsp;币圈投资经历的五大阶段，不同阶段的操作策略、收益表现以及心得体会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4572">01:16:12</a> 合约之痛：如何通过做合约爆仓200w美金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5413">01:30:13</a> 币圈适合普通人来参与么，为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5745">01:35:45</a> 能长期稳定赚取收益的人，都有哪些特征？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5823">01:37:03</a> 币圈Not to do list（不要加杠杆、不要只人云亦云、不要加过多的群）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6000">01:40:00</a> 对个人投资理念影响比较大的人（巴菲特、芒格、索罗斯、霍华德·马克斯、九神）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6240">01:44:00</a> 「市场情绪投资模型」：在前路模糊时入场，在人声鼎沸时离开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6405">01:46:45</a> 个人在开心生活上的一些小秘诀分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6605">01:50:05</a> “世上本无事，庸人自扰之” ，怎样修炼一个比较平和的心态？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6830">01:53:50</a> 曾国藩在生活以及投资上对我的启发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6965">01:56:05</a> 年度最值好物分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7293">02:01:33</a> 图灵完备是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《Take Care In Your Dreaming》The Avalanches / Denzel Curry / Tricky / Sampa the Great</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>特此说明：本播客所提及的内容，仅作为个人观点信息分享，不构成任何投资建议。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpeUMKSx4XLlmNXDuQFS6WI7KnQ-.m4a" length="122154128" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:05:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibUrpGZnVVlzWbQf2luqVon9h6P.jpg"/>
